-- ################################################################################################
-- # 321 - Georgia DHS coordinated transportation: a program, and its driver requirements.
-- #
-- # From DHS MAN1425, Coordinated Transportation System Transportation Manual, Chapter 2, Driver
-- # Requirements, Programs and Recordkeeping. A separate program from Medicaid NEMT: these reach a
-- # company that records DHS Coordinated Transportation on its operating profile, and count toward
-- # that program's qualification only.
-- #
-- # Not here: conduct standards (seat belts, no phones, no refuelling with riders aboard), notice
-- # duties (citations within five calendar days), the WEX fuel card rules, and the six-point limit -
-- # points are read off the MVR by whoever reviews it, so the limit sits in that rule's citation.
-- # All drafts.
-- ################################################################################################

